## Spatial and temporal transition map

```text
bergamot rind + petitgrain grain + pepper/juniper + aldehydic polish
    -> cardamom capsule + terpinyl/linalyl shell + beta-pinene edge
    -> Bontoux lavender body + altitude/spike pressure + bounded Hedione air
    -> dihydrojasmone/Jessemal tissue + coumarin/tonka crushed-seed interior
    -> damascenone/heliotropal/immortelle turn into violet-suede cloth
    -> Irotyl/Orivone/Vetikon connect the cloth to literal cedar and vetiver
    -> Polysantol yields under Kephalis/Cashmeran pressure
    -> coumarin + heliotropal + cedar grain recur through Ethylene Brassylate skin

0–5 min: cold cardamom capsule before citrus, pepper, or lavender
5–30 min: shell opens through lavender rather than separating from it
30–120 min: warm seed, almond grain, straw, and violet-suede complexion emerge
2–6 h: literal cedar/vetiver and one yielding wood interior deepen the same subject
6 h+: coumarinic skin and cedar-root relations recall cardamom without pretending the top remains unchanged
```

Every temporal statement above is design intent, not observed behavior.

## Selection and rejection decisions

| Register | Selected | Rejected or bounded alternative | Target-specific reason |
|---|---|---|---|
| Citrus/rind | Bergamot FCF Sicilian + Petitgrain Paraguay | Lemon FCF, Cedrat, Mandarin, Grapefruit | Bergamot supplies polished nocturnal rind and petitgrain supplies bitter pod grain; lemon/citron sharpen toward daylight and mandarin sweetens |
| Cold shell | Cardamom, terpinyl/linalyl/linalool continuity, diluted Juniper and Beta-Pinene, micro Leafovert/Dynascone/Scentenal | Dihydromyrcenol, Verdox, Calone, large Galbanum | The selected terpenoid/ester family belongs to cardamom and lavender; rejected materials pull blue, apple-green, aquatic, or chypre |
| Lavender air | Three lavender naturals + one bounded Hedione row | Hedione HC and a generic muguet field | One transparent field prevents White Fire-like split radiance and keeps lavender recognizable |
| Warm seed | Coumarin, Tonkarome, Tonka Absolute, Jessemal, Heliotropal, Damascenone, and Immortelle | Vanillin, benzoin, maple lactone, cocoa, lactones, baseline Carrot Seed EO, and baseline cinnamon | The selected materials build dry seed, hay, fatty tissue, almond grain, and straw without dessert architecture; carrot and cinnamon are withheld until their own evidence gates can support informative doses |
| Violet cloth | Givaudan AIMI, ionones, Irotyl, Orivone, Suederal | Alpha Irone and Ultralia | The selected chord is violet-suede tailoring; irone/Ultralia raise Dior/Prada lipstick-powder risk |
| Woods | Virginia cedar, Cedarwood EO, Indian vetiver, Vetikon, Polysantol, one Kephalis contour | Cedramber, Clearwood, Vertofix, Sandalore, Ebanol, Javanol, Azarbre, Ambrofix, Amberwood F, Timberol, Norlimbanol | Literal LNDL wood and root replace the donor-shaped multi-wood/amber chassis; Polysantol owns the sole yielding interior |
| Fixation | Hexyl Salicylate + Benzyl Benzoate | Benzyl Salicylate | Transparent film and quiet mass avoid a White Fire-like waxy cosmetic cushion |
| Musk | Ethylene Brassylate only | Romandolide, Habanolide, Ambrettolide, Galaxolide, Tonalide, Macrolide, Musk Ketone | EB alone echoes coumarin/heliotropal cream; other musks add projection, laundry, fruit-wine, or redundant skin axes |

